{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Replica and Feed Editions","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"PSReaderUI"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Replica-and-Feed-Editions","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The PSReaderUI SDK supports two distinct backend systems for delivering digital","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"publication content. Which system your publications use determines the content","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"types you configure, the analytics events you receive, and which delegate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"methods the SDK calls.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Consult the PageSuite portal or your account manager to determine which system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applies to your publications."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Shortcodes","text":"Shortcodes"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"shortcode"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is a remote configuration set up in the PageSuite portal that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"maps to your publication setup. When you use a shortcode with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".dynamicArchive"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the SDK fetches this configuration and automatically populates the correct"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"publications — routing to either the feed or replica system as appropriate."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":[".dynamicArchive(\"Editions\", shortcode: \"SHORTCODE\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"recommended approach","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for loading content. You don’t need to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"manage GUIDs yourself or know which backend system your publications use — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shortcode handles it. See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Carousel-Setup","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for more detail on configuring","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sections.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Feed-Editions","text":"Feed Editions"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Feed editions are the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"modern"}]},{"type":"text","text":" content system. They deliver a mix of HTML"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"article templates and PDF pages, enabling responsive layouts that adapt to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"different screen sizes and orientations. Key advantages over replica editions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"include:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich templates"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — elaborate article layouts such as multi-column templates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that go beyond a static PDF reproduction."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In-flow advertising"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — greater support for ads placed directly within"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"article content."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Faster backend","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — improved content delivery for quicker load times."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Feed edition publications are identified by an ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"application GUID","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". When","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"configuring sections manually (without a shortcode), use the ","type":"text"},{"code":".feedArchive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"content type:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":[".section(.init(name: \"Editions\", type: .feedArchive(guid: \"APP_GUID\")))"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Replica-Editions","text":"Replica Editions"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Replica editions are the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"legacy"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" content system. They deliver PDF-only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pages that reproduce the print layout of a publication. Users navigate through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a faithful digital replica of the printed product."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Replica publications are identified by a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"publication GUID"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". When configuring","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sections manually (without a shortcode), use the ","type":"text"},{"code":".replicaArchive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" content type:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":[".section(.init(name: \"Editions\", type: .replicaArchive(guid: \"PUB_GUID\")))"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Transition","text":"Transition"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PageSuite is transitioning publications from the replica system to feed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editions. New publications are typically set up as feed editions, while"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"existing replica publications may be migrated over time. Your account manager"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can advise on the timeline and steps for any migration."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Impact-on-the-SDK","text":"Impact on the SDK"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The backend system affects several areas of the SDK:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Content types"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Use "},{"code":".feedArchive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for feed editions and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".replicaArchive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for replica editions when configuring sections manually."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"code":".dynamicArchive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with a shortcode to let the SDK choose automatically."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Analytics events"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Feed editions emit "},{"code":"feedEdition*","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" events; replica"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editions emit "},{"code":"replica*","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" events. See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Analytics","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Paywall delegate methods","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — Separate delegate methods exist for opening"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and downloading feed vs replica editions. See "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Paywall-Integration"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Share delegate methods"}]},{"text":" — Separate methods handle sharing for feed pages","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and replica spreads. See ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Sharing","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Audio delegate methods"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — Separate methods handle TTS for feed pages"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and replica spreads. See "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Text-to-Speech"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Replica-Reader-Variants","text":"Replica Reader Variants"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Replica editions can be displayed using one of two reader implementations:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Legacy reader"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — the original PDF reader with its own navigation and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"toolbar UI. Configured via "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/LegacyReaderConfiguration","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Modern reader","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — a newer implementation whose look and feel matches the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feed edition reader, providing a consistent experience across both systems."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The active reader is controlled by "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/ReaderConfiguration\/useLegacyReplicaReader"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The default is currently "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (legacy), but will change to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" (modern)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in a future release. If you are starting a new integration, consider using the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"modern reader from the outset."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreaderui\/replica-and-feed-editions"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreaderui\/replica-and-feed-editions"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Understand the two backend systems that power PSReaderUI content."}],"references":{"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI/documentation/PSReaderUI/Sharing":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Sharing","role":"article","kind":"article","title":"Sharing","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure how users share edition content from the reader."}],"url":"\/documentation\/psreaderui\/sharing","type":"topic"},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI/documentation/PSReaderUI/Text-to-Speech":{"type":"topic","role":"article","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Text-to-Speech","abstract":[{"text":"Add audio playback of article content using the SDK’s text-to-speech system.","type":"text"}],"title":"Text-to-Speech","url":"\/documentation\/psreaderui\/text-to-speech"},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI/documentation/PSReaderUI/Carousel-Setup":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Carousel-Setup","role":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/psreaderui\/carousel-setup","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure the carousel’s sections, content sources, and layout."}],"title":"Carousel Setup"},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI/documentation/PSReaderUI/ReaderConfiguration/useLegacyReplicaReader":{"url":"\/documentation\/psreaderui\/readerconfiguration\/uselegacyreplicareader","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":", uses the legacy replica reader instead of the modern implementation."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/ReaderConfiguration\/useLegacyReplicaReader","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"useLegacyReplicaReader","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"useLegacyReplicaReader"},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI/documentation/PSReaderUI":{"title":"PSReaderUI","abstract":[{"text":"A UI framework for building digital newspaper and magazine reader experiences on iOS.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/psreaderui","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI","role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI/documentation/PSReaderUI/Paywall-Integration":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"article","title":"Paywall Integration","url":"\/documentation\/psreaderui\/paywall-integration","abstract":[{"text":"Restrict access to premium content with custom paywall screens.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Paywall-Integration"},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI/documentation/PSReaderUI/LegacyReaderConfiguration":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LegacyReaderConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Configuration object for customizing the appearance, behavior, and sharing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"strategies of the legacy replica reader."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"LegacyReaderConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/LegacyReaderConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/psreaderui\/legacyreaderconfiguration","title":"LegacyReaderConfiguration","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI/documentation/PSReaderUI/Analytics":{"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/psreaderui\/analytics","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Analytics","title":"Analytics","type":"topic","role":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Track user interactions and content engagement across the PSReaderUI SDK.","type":"text"}]}},"variantOverrides":[{"patch":[{"value":"occ","path":"\/identifier\/interfaceLanguage","op":"replace"},{"value":null,"path":"\/topicSections","op":"add"},{"value":null,"path":"\/seeAlsoSections","op":"add"}],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}]}